<h2 id="includes">What This Service Includes</h2>
<p>Growth for a regenerative program is a mix of referral development, positioning, and patient acquisition. We help you build each of those on a foundation the practice can stand behind — accurate, patient-focused, and consistent with how the program actually works.</p>

<h3>What We Help Build</h3>
<div class="dash-list">
  <div class="dash-list-item">Business development strategy for the regenerative service line</div>
  <div class="dash-list-item">Physician and practice branding that reflects the standard of care you deliver</div>
  <div class="dash-list-item">Referral development with the physicians and sources who see these patients</div>
  <div class="dash-list-item">Patient acquisition grounded in clear, accurate education</div>
</div>

<h2 id="referrals">Referral Development</h2>
<p>Many of the right patients are already being seen somewhere — by physicians who currently refer them out or tell them to wait. A well-run referral program gives those sources a clear, credible reason to send patients to your program, and gives you a repeatable pipeline rather than a slow trickle of word of mouth.</p>

<h2 id="branding">Physician Branding &amp; Patient Acquisition</h2>
<p>How your program is presented matters as much as what it does. We help position the practice and its physicians around the things that actually differentiate the program — one consistent, ultrasound-guided protocol, an in-office and non-surgical option, and a documented standard of care — so patients understand what they're choosing.</p>

<div class="callout">
  <div class="callout-label">Marketing you can stand behind</div>
  <p class="callout-body">We keep patient-facing messaging accurate and open. That means no unverified outcome claims and no overselling — because the fastest way to lose referral sources is to promise more than the program delivers.</p>
</div>

